  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Assembly Chain",
      "items": [
        "AssemblyInterface wired in topological DependsOn order",
        "Env → Config → Logger → Database → Redis → Cache",
        "Before install Redis is nil and the cache falls back to memory"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Checks & Reload",
      "items": [
        "goose versioned migrations (24 files per dialect) then app.ready",
        "SIGHUP / API trigger an in-process ReloadAssemblies",
        "Restart() replaces the process via syscall.Exec, keeping the PID"
